{"product":{"id":10040245813536,"title":"Terreno PRO T50 Mixed Gravel Race","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRacing performance for hardpack to mixed terrain.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for versatility, the Terreno PRO T50 Mixed Gravel Race is the quiver killer of gravel tires, offering a directional siping texture working in harmony with carefully placed knobs to deliver enhanced traction across a wide variety of terrains. A balanced center and mid-tread ensure speed and stability on straights, while confident cornering lugs provide control when the course turns technical. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFast is fun, but we aimed higher. The Terreno PRO range is built with 92% renewable and recycled materials, making it the most sustainable tire Vittoria has ever created. Compared to the average competitor, it is 7% faster, 9% grippier, and 34% more puncture resistant, proving that going green doesn’t mean compromising.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis award winning tire rolls with a 53% lower carbon footprint versus the Gravel Endurance construction, Terreno PRO T50 Mixed shows that sustainability and speed can ride side by side, representing a new era of cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2025-09-04T20:59:02-05:00","handle":"terreno-pro-t50-mixed-gravel-race","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:11-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-11T08:58:59-06:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Race, IPP40, Tires","variants":[{"id":50664001929504,"product_id":10040245813536,"title":"700x35c \/ Brown","price":"112.99","sku":"11A01144","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"700x35c","option2":"Brown","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-09-04T20:59:02-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:11-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530037563","grams":550,"image_id"